WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.500
Unweighted model: scores from the 2024 test.

00:03.300 --> 00:06.800
Shared DC data define low-demand hours.
Historical evaluation and browser refit are separate.

00:07.600 --> 00:12.100
Unweighted 2024 estimates simulate time shifts.
Only forecasts compare eligible browser hours.

00:12.900 --> 00:16.400
AQI and smoke: observational associations.
Seoul uses its own data, split and model.

00:17.200 --> 00:20.200
Compare five models on 8,204 test hours from 2024.

00:21.000 --> 00:23.000
ROC: true-positive versus false-positive rates.

00:23.800 --> 00:25.800
Precision–recall curves for the low-demand label.

00:26.600 --> 00:29.600
Mean prediction: 6.88%; observed rate: 2.46%.
Probabilities overestimate low demand.

00:30.400 --> 00:32.400
Compare the recorded model scores.

00:33.200 --> 00:36.700
Simulated recovery: 36.8% with full transfer;
18.4% assuming 50% transfer efficiency.
